      "why": "Only pipelined/pipelined_m give 1 result/cycle, the sole route to >=400 MSPS. Full pipelining (m=1) is the baseline for max Fmax; n_iter 12-20 and data_width 14-22 bracket the 2^-12 accuracy requirement while keeping LUTs low. angle_guard/frac_guard kept small to minimize area."
